els/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-01-17T01:27:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-07T20:27:28Z","closed_at":"2026-06-07T20:27:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.5.1.stable.official [[f62fdbde1](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/f62fdbde1)]\n\n### System information\n\nFedora Linux 43 - Godot v4.5.1.stable - Steam Runtime 2 (soldier) 2 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 (nvidia) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 30.97 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nLightmaps baked with the **Use Physical Light Units** option enabled are rather noisy when compared to when its disabled.\n\n| Disabled | Enabled |\n| --- | --- |\n| <img width=\"759\" height=\"645\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d16890d-34b4-4ac8-b64c-1dcd63a4c7fe\" /> | <img width=\"759\" height=\"645\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f47df23f-eb80-472a-993b-9a52429a357d\" /> |\n\nThis issue still occurs, even when the light was created while the setting was already enabled.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Ensure **Use Physical Light Units** is enabled (Rendering > Lights and Shadows > Use Physical Light Units\")\n- Create a scene with a LightmapGI Node\n- Add any kind of light source (a directional light makes it most apparent)\n- Bake the lightmap\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MinProjNoisyPhysicalLight.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24684026/MinProjNoisyPhysicalLight.zip)\nNote: The archive does not contain a lightmap, so it'll need to be baked anew.","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115056/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115056/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}